.TH MDV 1 "November 2026" "mdv 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mdv \- super fast terminal markdown viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mdv
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE\fR...
.br
.B mdv
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fB\-\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mdv
renders markdown with colors, tables, syntax-highlighted code and clickable
links, and shows it in a built-in less-style pager. When standard output is
not a terminal it prints plain text wrapped to 80 columns instead. With no
\fIFILE\fR, or when \fIFILE\fR is \fB\-\fR, it reads standard input.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-no\-pager
Print the rendered output to standard output instead of opening the pager.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-plain
Disable colors. This is the default when standard output is not a terminal.
.TP
.B \-\-color
Force colors, for example \fBmdv \-n \-\-color FILE | less \-R\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-urls
Do not show link URLs after the link text.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.BR j " " k ", " Down " " Up ", " Enter
Scroll one line down / up.
.TP
.BR d " " u ", " Ctrl\-D " " Ctrl\-U
Scroll half a page down / up.
.TP
.BR f " " b ", " Space ", " PgDn " " PgUp
Scroll a page down / up.
.TP
.BR gg " " G ", " Home " " End
Go to the top / bottom.
.TP
.BR / " " ?
Search forward / backward (case-insensitive).
.TP
.BR n " " N
Go to the next / previous match.
.TP
.BR ] " " [
Show the next / previous file.
.TP
.BR q ", " Esc
Quit, or move on to the next file when several were given.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
When set, colors are disabled unless \fB\-\-color\fR is given.
.TP
.B TERM
When \fBdumb\fR, colors are disabled unless \fB\-\-color\fR is given.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 if a file could not be read, 2 on usage errors.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
mdv README.md
mdv a.md b.md
curl \-s https://example.com/notes.md | mdv
mdv notes.md | grep TODO
.fi
